  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formulation Mission: Formulation of programme on promotion of free trade and economic integration in Africa

?The objective and purpose is to assist the Embassy in Nairobi in the programming of a 200 mill DKK programme for promotion of free trade and economic integration in Africa with 50 mill DKK to be committed in 2024 (see FFL24 &#xa7; 06.32.01.23). The task would include drafting of a well-defined inception note as well as programme document in accordance with formats defined by relevant guidelines.</narrative>
  </description>
